{
  "name": "@dsh-plugins/dockyard",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "本机开发服务的可观测托管台：扫描项目、受监管地启停应用、tail 日志，并在 DSH 侧栏提供状态面板。",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json"
  },
  "icon": "./icon.svg",
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "src",
    "locale",
    "icon.svg",
    "cordis.patch.yml"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test test/*.test.mjs",
    "lint": "eslint .",
    "typecheck": "tsc -p tsconfig.json"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": "0.2.0-rc.2",
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "3.18.4"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": []
    }
  },
  "$comment": "插件必须能独立安装到任意 profile，因此依赖只用可安装的 spec（真实版本号）。共享工具以同步副本形式放在 src/internal/，原因见各文件头。宿主内部包必须声明为真实依赖：实测外部插件无法凭空解析它们。安装时用 file: 或 registry spec，link: 不会解析依赖树。"
}
